{"ticker":"CAT","updated":"2026-11-27T22:42:33Z","profile":{"longName":"Caterpillar Inc.","shortName":"Caterpillar, Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Farm & Heavy Construction Machinery","country":"United States","website":"https://www.caterpillar.com","fullTimeEmployees":118000,"marketCap":257048952832,"trailingPE":22.04631,"forwardPE":17.454578,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.3051183,"pegRatio":0.97,"targetMeanPrice":807.2604,"targetHighPrice":1027.0,"targetLowPrice":575.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":26,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.173,"earningsGrowth":0.461,"grossMargins":0.29542,"operatingMargins":0.18761,"profitMargins":0.15212,"totalRevenue":77772996608,"beta":1.64,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":1073.46,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":508.11,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.2},"summary":"Caterpillar Inc. provides construction and mining equipment, off-highway diesel and natural gas engines, industrial gas turbines, and diesel-electric locomotives in the United States and internationally. The Construction Industries segment offers asphalt pavers, cold planers, compactors, forestry machines, material handlers, motor graders, pipelayers, road reclaimers, telehandlers, track-type tractors, and track and wheel excavators; backhoe, compact track, skid steer, track-type, and wheel loaders; and related parts and work tools. Its Resource Industries segment provides electric rope and hydraulic shovels, draglines, rotary drills, hard rock vehicles, mining trucks, wheel loaders, off-highway and articulated trucks, wide-body trucks, wheel tractor scrapers and dozers, and landfill and soil compactors; machinery components, and wear and maintenance components; and technology products and services for fleet management, equipment management analytics, autonomous machine capabilities, safety services, and mining performance solutions. The Energy & Transportation segment offers reciprocating engine powered generator sets; reciprocating engines, drivetrain, and integrated systems and solutions; centrifugal gas compressors and related services; and diesel-electric locomotive components, and other rail-related products. Its Financial Products segment provides operating and finance l","summary_zh":"Caterpillar Inc. 在美國和國際上提供建築和採礦設備、非公路柴油和天然氣發動機、工業燃氣渦輪機以及柴電機車。建築行業部門提供瀝青攤舖機、冷鉋機、壓實機、林業機械、物料搬運機、平地機、舖管機、道路回收機、伸縮臂叉裝機、履帶式拖拉機以及履帶式和輪式挖掘機；反鏟裝載機、緊湊型履帶式裝載機、滑移轉向裝載機、履帶式裝載機和輪式裝載機；以及相關零件和作業機具。其資源工業部門提供電繩索和液壓鏟、拉鏟、旋轉鑽機、硬岩車輛、礦用卡車、輪式裝載機、非公路和鉸接式卡車、寬體卡車、輪式拖拉機鏟運機和推土機以及垃圾掩埋場和土壤壓實機；機械部件、磨損和維護部件；以及用於車隊管理、設備管理分析、自主機器功能解決方案、採礦和維修服務、獨立機器功能解決方案。能源與運輸部門提供往復式發動機驅動的發電機組；往復式發動機、傳動系統以及集成系統和解決方案；離心式氣體壓縮機及相關服務；和柴油電力機車部件以及其他鐵路相關產品。其金融產品部門提供營運和融資服務","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"農業和重型工程機械","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":468.08,"h":472.49,"l":467.46,"c":471.61,"v":2892100},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":471.62,"h":477.44,"l":470.24,"c":477.15,"v":2315300},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":474.01,"h":483.93,"l":471.14,"c":480.82,"v":2964700},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":486.86,"h":495.98,"l":484.19,"c":490.57,"v":2648600},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":493.25,"h":504.48,"l":492.53,"c":497.85,"v":2996500},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":500.42,"h":505.59,"l":493.04,"c":495.38,"v":2629200},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":497.93,"h":498.38,"l":483.55,"c":486.71,"v":2135400},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":490.99,"h":509.48,"l":489.34,"c":502.12,"v":3959400},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":504.06,"h":506.53,"l":497.14,"c":500.36,"v":3113900},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":503.12,"h":511.5,"l":491.3,"c":491.3,"v":3889100},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":502.15,"h":506.38,"l":495.45,"c":504.76,"v":2618400},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":500.58,"h":531.56,"l":499.01,"c":527.47,"v":5459800},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":534.2,"h":538.45,"l":527.21,"c":534.05,"v":3447100},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":538.06,"h":544.99,"l":534.7,"c":540.96,"v":3463100},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":537.38,"h":542.21,"l":526.97,"c":527.08,"v":2814700},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":529.56,"h":534.2,"l":526.94,"c":531.18,"v":2170800},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":525.07,"h":533.38,"l":522.04,"c":524.65,"v":2259100},